      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1445,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 125,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "text": "Before dispatch: atomically invalidate unsent V,\nrelease eligible reservations, create V+1.\nNew amounts / credits / beneficiary / policy\nrequire new approval. If an attempt began,\nresolve the old command before replacement.",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
