      "id": "w_return_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1624,
      "width": 1595,
      "height": 100,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "text": "RETURN PATH: fetch original debit + distinct return transaction -> post each verified effect once -> reopen AP -> reconcile both.\nExample (USD, no fees): settlement Dr AP 100 / Cr cash 100; verified return Dr cash 100 / Cr AP 100.\nReturn-first? Fetch both. Missing evidence -> hold. Credits stay consumed; reopen only the returned cash principal.\nRe-payment needs a newly approved command after the original outcome and obligations are resolved.",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "seed": 740009,
      "originalText": "RETURN PATH: fetch original debit + distinct return transaction -> post each verified effect once -> reopen AP -> reconcile both.\nExample (USD, no fees): settlement Dr AP 100 / Cr cash 100; verified return Dr cash 100 / Cr AP 100.\nReturn-first? Fetch both. Missing evidence -> hold. Credits stay consumed; reopen only the returned cash principal.\nRe-payment needs a newly approved command after the original outcome and obligations are resolved.",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
