      "height": 45,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "text": "Design source: issue #39 M0–M5, R04–R12; current ap/payments/handlers entry points require changes.\nDemo proof: accept -> lose response -> restart worker -> recover same command -> post once -> reconcile. No runtime implementation claimed.",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
